WEBVTT

00:08.050 --> 00:10.530
Thanks for comin', everyone!

00:10.780 --> 00:12.230
Did you all have fun?

00:12.520 --> 00:14.120
What's going on…?

00:14.280 --> 00:15.980
B-Beats me…

00:27.110 --> 00:29.510
You really are an interesting guy, Ume!

00:32.870 --> 00:35.200
Alright, that's it for today!

00:35.380 --> 00:37.380
Everybody head home!

00:38.490 --> 00:42.620
Hey, are there any places
to get take-out around here?

00:44.330 --> 00:45.240
Why…?

00:46.020 --> 00:47.390
What do you mean, "why"?

00:48.500 --> 00:51.030
We're having an after-party!

00:53.800 --> 00:57.480
Woo! Cheers! That's a wrap!

00:59.200 --> 01:00.300
What…

01:00.910 --> 01:02.800
Why are we doin' this outside?

01:02.920 --> 01:04.880
You can't do a banquet indoors!

01:05.410 --> 01:08.290
- The hell is going on here?
- Scoot in or you'll get wet, Sakura.

01:08.290 --> 01:10.220
That was quite the rainstorm.

02:44.760 --> 02:47.230
Man, everything looks great.

02:47.540 --> 02:50.370
I wouldn't expect any less
of a bar district's menu!

02:51.010 --> 02:53.990
Alright, down the hatch!

02:56.220 --> 02:57.210
Delicious!

02:58.340 --> 02:59.970
These are all delish!

03:00.630 --> 03:02.410
- It really is good.
- This is great, too!

03:03.070 --> 03:05.410
Ah, they did give us some lemon!

03:05.740 --> 03:07.780
Squeeze it on your own food, dumbass!

03:08.320 --> 03:11.610
I-I'm surprised they have
appetites in a situation like this.

03:11.760 --> 03:12.890
Right?

03:13.780 --> 03:17.120
You agree, Suo? Thank goodness,
I thought I was alone in that.

03:17.180 --> 03:19.600
Oh, no, I'm just on a diet.

03:19.720 --> 03:20.620
A diet?!

03:22.870 --> 03:24.220
What's his deal?

03:25.070 --> 03:28.440
How can he eat with a guy
he was only just fighting?

03:29.930 --> 03:30.780
I mean…

03:31.820 --> 03:33.810
Can you even call that a fight?

03:34.400 --> 03:36.040
How could he forgive that?

03:37.300 --> 03:38.570
I know I couldn't…

03:39.110 --> 03:41.500
Oh? Something wrong, Togame?

03:41.830 --> 03:43.510
You haven't touched a thing.

03:51.500 --> 03:52.840
I'm sorry.

03:56.490 --> 04:02.090
If you look at the lead-up
to this fight… It was all my fault.

04:02.760 --> 04:05.030
Lion's Head going rotten,

04:05.670 --> 04:08.060
yesterday's confrontation, today,

04:08.330 --> 04:09.250
all of it.

04:09.990 --> 04:12.310
I'm really sorry.

04:12.490 --> 04:14.350
Kame, I'm at fault, too!

04:26.500 --> 04:27.500
You heard 'em.

04:27.920 --> 04:29.430
Whatcha wanna do, Sakura?

04:31.820 --> 04:33.160
The choice is yours.

04:34.330 --> 04:35.120
Huh?!

04:36.510 --> 04:38.380
I'll take any punishment you give.

04:40.010 --> 04:42.000
That's the right thing to do.

04:55.180 --> 04:56.050
Promise me!

04:56.380 --> 04:58.100
You'll become a cool guy!

04:58.760 --> 05:00.580
And you'll never be lame again!

05:03.020 --> 05:04.060
You hear me?!

05:10.500 --> 05:11.810
I promise.

05:17.500 --> 05:20.410
Alright, that's the end of that!

05:21.150 --> 05:23.000
Oh? What's this?

05:24.630 --> 05:25.580
Mmm!

05:26.930 --> 05:28.380
It's fried burdock!

05:30.210 --> 05:34.910
Ume. You're top dog, so why do you
seem to have so much fun?

05:38.090 --> 05:41.070
Well, you see, I love to eat.

05:46.760 --> 05:50.130
I love eating, too! Curry's my favorite!

05:50.320 --> 05:51.220
What about you?

05:51.490 --> 05:53.190
I'm a rice omelette man.

05:53.410 --> 05:55.980
Oh, but I'm not so into the food itself.

05:56.480 --> 06:00.000
What I'm about is having
a good time eating with everyone.

06:00.600 --> 06:02.100
Chatting about stuff,

06:02.490 --> 06:03.820
laughing my head off.

06:04.100 --> 06:06.920
It makes all the bad stuff stop mattering.

06:07.620 --> 06:10.510
Nothing's more fun than times like this.

06:11.110 --> 06:14.110
That's why I'm having tons of fun right now!

06:14.820 --> 06:16.480
And hey, all that?

06:17.030 --> 06:20.730
It has nothing at all to do with me being top dog.

06:22.670 --> 06:24.950
Yeah, that's right…

06:25.680 --> 06:30.230
I remembered how much fun I had
before I took over.

06:30.830 --> 06:33.690
When everyone laughed, it made me happy, too.

06:34.560 --> 06:37.130
But I didn't realize it then.

06:37.860 --> 06:41.240
I ended up thinking I'd
have fun if I became top dog.

06:49.630 --> 06:53.080
Why didn't I notice, though…?

06:55.520 --> 07:01.690
I mean, people don't go, "Man, I love oxygen!"
with each breath, do they?

07:02.440 --> 07:08.810
You didn't notice because you were
already having enough fun it didn't register.

07:10.410 --> 07:13.010
Good thing you noticed before you lost it all.

07:13.820 --> 07:16.500
Really. I'm happy for you.

07:23.430 --> 07:25.870
Hey, can I ask one more thing?

07:26.170 --> 07:26.760
Hm?

07:27.300 --> 07:31.700
If you knew all that already,
why did you become top dog?

07:39.860 --> 07:44.030
Because I wanted to have fun
eating with everyone all the time!

07:47.220 --> 07:50.080
If everyone's happy and smiling,

07:50.580 --> 07:52.620
then I can enjoy my food.

07:56.400 --> 08:00.140
That's why, when I thought of
what I could do in this town,

08:00.630 --> 08:04.730
I settled on being Furin's top dog. That's all.

08:06.380 --> 08:08.710
Being top dog wasn't my goal,

08:09.050 --> 08:11.950
but rather the things it would let me do.

08:12.740 --> 08:14.380
If there was a better way,

08:14.540 --> 08:16.470
I'd probably have done that instead.

08:17.080 --> 08:18.640
But if that happened,

08:19.070 --> 08:21.860
I wouldn't be here eating with you guys!

08:26.010 --> 08:28.670
You really are something else, Ume.

08:29.000 --> 08:32.220
You actually understood yourself
before becoming top dog.

08:32.380 --> 08:34.900
Not quite. I didn't "become" top dog.

08:38.420 --> 08:40.090
I was made top dog.

08:42.180 --> 08:44.350
You can't take the spot on your own.

08:46.310 --> 08:50.450
I was able to become top dog
because everyone supported me.

08:51.090 --> 08:55.190
They agreed with what I wanted to do,
and helped make it reality.

08:55.790 --> 08:59.110
That made me realize something
when I became top dog.

08:59.720 --> 09:03.800
My wishes weren't mine alone.

09:04.880 --> 09:08.300
And because I want to grant those wishes,

09:08.900 --> 09:13.670
no matter how hard, unfair,
or unreasonable things get,

09:17.820 --> 09:20.700
I'll never lose.

09:33.880 --> 09:37.590
You're carrying everything on your back, Ume.

09:38.220 --> 09:40.600
Your punches are light.

09:41.090 --> 09:42.610
Do you know why that is?

09:43.340 --> 09:45.550
Because there's nothing behind them.

09:48.160 --> 09:49.220
Choji…

09:50.120 --> 09:51.620
Aw, man.

09:55.190 --> 09:58.200
My punches really were light!

09:59.910 --> 10:01.600
I can't beat that!

10:06.840 --> 10:10.010
Later! Come hang with us sometime!

10:10.360 --> 10:12.310
The food here was tasty and all,

10:12.450 --> 10:14.730
but we've got tons of good stuff, too!

10:14.850 --> 10:15.670
Can we?!

10:15.780 --> 10:16.760
You bet!

10:17.210 --> 10:19.700
I wish I brought something for you…

10:19.770 --> 10:20.180
Ah!

10:21.990 --> 10:24.530
I forgot I bought a red bean bun at Saboten!

10:25.660 --> 10:29.060
Want it? Their bread's great, even cold!

10:29.370 --> 10:32.500
Man, that's way beyond just "cold" by now.

10:33.060 --> 10:34.060
Thanks!

10:35.300 --> 10:36.950
Come get a fresh one sometime!

10:37.070 --> 10:37.660
Mhm.

10:53.850 --> 10:55.550
See ya later!

10:57.490 --> 10:59.120
See ya!

11:08.610 --> 11:09.880
And they're gone.

11:10.460 --> 11:11.100
Mm.

11:12.510 --> 11:14.080
Hey, Kame.

11:14.450 --> 11:15.090
Hm?

11:16.050 --> 11:17.690
I get it.

11:19.480 --> 11:23.490
I know an apology won't fix what I did.

11:25.340 --> 11:25.940
Mm.

11:26.630 --> 11:29.790
But I don't know what
I should do to make it right.

11:30.300 --> 11:32.270
I don't even know what I can do.

11:33.750 --> 11:35.330
But I still…

11:36.220 --> 11:37.210
I…

11:38.380 --> 11:39.960
I need you guys.

11:41.160 --> 11:42.060
So please…

11:43.940 --> 11:45.550
Same here.

11:46.390 --> 11:48.710
I can't take back what I did.

11:50.530 --> 11:52.490
I want to make amends somehow,

11:53.030 --> 11:56.880
but I don't know what to do other than apologize.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.880
But that's all the more reason…

12:02.750 --> 12:04.750
I have to face them.

12:08.920 --> 12:12.260
How about we try to find
an answer together this time?

12:16.670 --> 12:17.330
Mhm!

12:26.450 --> 12:27.710
What's so funny?

12:28.340 --> 12:31.830
It may be all smooshed,
but it's still a good bean bun!

12:34.710 --> 12:36.390
It's real good!

12:36.670 --> 12:38.470
I wonder how good a fresh one is?

12:52.260 --> 12:54.190
Huh? Is it raining again?

12:57.920 --> 13:01.300
You're right! That sure is weird.

13:02.620 --> 13:06.510
Even though the sun is out…

13:10.110 --> 13:11.110
Welcome back.

13:45.160 --> 13:48.170
Sasaki! Don't tell me
you were waiting the whole time!

13:49.730 --> 13:51.610
U-Um!

13:57.230 --> 13:59.090
I told you to leave it to us.

14:01.820 --> 14:03.100
It's done.

14:09.110 --> 14:09.950
Thank you…

14:11.090 --> 14:14.540
Thank you all so much!

14:18.460 --> 14:20.300
We're baaack!

14:20.450 --> 14:24.130
Welcome ba… wait,
you've already been patched up?

14:24.230 --> 14:27.860
- Kotoha! Your bro's back home!
- So what went down with Lion's Head?

14:27.860 --> 14:29.480
We're, uh, friends now?

14:29.620 --> 14:31.610
- You always come back a mess.
- Well, we got home safe.

14:32.070 --> 14:33.210
You okay?

14:33.660 --> 14:35.190
This is nothin'.

14:36.800 --> 14:38.860
You look surprisingly clean.

14:39.150 --> 14:41.710
I'm not really the sweating type.

14:42.540 --> 14:44.510
You're a mess, too, Sakura.

14:46.250 --> 14:47.110
Welcome back.

14:50.550 --> 14:52.920
Because you're alone.

14:55.160 --> 14:59.000
I was able to become top dog
because everyone supported me.

14:59.350 --> 15:03.300
They agreed with what I wanted to do,
and helped make it reality.

15:03.950 --> 15:05.740
What's up, Sakura?

15:06.000 --> 15:08.230
You've been clammed up the whole way back.

15:08.570 --> 15:09.380
I'm leaving.

15:09.670 --> 15:11.890
Eh?! What's wrong, Sakura?

15:13.040 --> 15:14.500
Wait just a sec.

15:14.890 --> 15:15.770
What're you…?!

15:15.770 --> 15:18.970
This is a day to remember! We gotta celebrate!

15:19.220 --> 15:22.080
Kotoha! Get us special coffees!

15:24.950 --> 15:26.920
There's nothing to celebrate here!

15:27.210 --> 15:29.730
You had a nice conversation with your fight.

15:29.880 --> 15:31.830
That makes this Conversation Day!

15:31.990 --> 15:35.070
Huh?! What kinda nonsense is that?!

15:35.230 --> 15:37.410
What's Conversation Day?

15:37.650 --> 15:40.760
Hmm, maybe something like Salad Day?

15:42.400 --> 15:43.820
- Celebrate on your own.
- Hey.

15:44.220 --> 15:46.460
I wanna talk. With you.

15:50.350 --> 15:52.770
I thought I could become top dog on my own.

15:54.220 --> 15:56.810
That the strongest guy would be top dog.

15:58.040 --> 16:00.720
But it looks like I was wrong…

16:04.680 --> 16:06.800
So, how was it?

16:07.100 --> 16:08.820
Your conversation with Togame?

16:10.310 --> 16:12.570
I mean, it wasn't, really.

16:13.160 --> 16:15.290
I didn't hear anything from his fists.

16:19.800 --> 16:23.420
I get it now! That's how you took it, huh?

16:23.870 --> 16:26.710
How surprising! Sakura's a romanticist!

16:26.970 --> 16:29.220
Sakura, that's silly even for you.

16:29.850 --> 16:31.880
What's your problem?! Stop laughing!

16:32.100 --> 16:35.700
Man, I'm sorry.
Guess I didn't explain well enough.

16:36.120 --> 16:38.860
But you really are a straightforward guy, huh?

16:39.190 --> 16:41.280
This ain't telepathy.

16:41.420 --> 16:43.770
Even I don't hear anything from fists!

16:47.470 --> 16:49.670
When I said punches are a language,

16:50.000 --> 16:51.820
I didn't mean actual words.

16:52.300 --> 16:55.800
I meant they're a way to make
thoughts known. To understand.

16:56.670 --> 17:00.520
A method older than language. More primitive.

17:00.900 --> 17:03.620
So what they can convey is also primitive.

17:03.980 --> 17:05.150
Primitive how?

17:06.530 --> 17:08.850
Y'know, things like love and hate.

17:10.930 --> 17:12.230
My eyes!

17:12.230 --> 17:13.690
Hang on, Sugishita!

17:13.800 --> 17:15.860
Look at that poison spray!

17:15.860 --> 17:19.980
What are you guys doing?!
You're cleaning that yourselves!

17:22.180 --> 17:23.820
Sorry, Kotoha.

17:26.170 --> 17:30.810
So, while you were conversing with Togame,
you came to like the guy, yeah?

17:32.050 --> 17:32.770
Huh?!

17:33.980 --> 17:38.480
That's why you tried to punch Tomiyama afterward.

17:40.700 --> 17:44.320
I think that's a sure sign
you had a real conversation.

17:46.530 --> 17:49.430
S-So what if I did?!

17:49.570 --> 17:51.620
Why is that something to celebrate?!

17:52.200 --> 17:53.620
Well, that's obvious.

17:56.550 --> 17:58.020
'Cause I'm happy for you!

17:58.530 --> 17:59.370
Huh?

17:59.600 --> 18:03.570
You see, I heard somebody
was coming from out of town.

18:03.800 --> 18:07.750
I thought, "Now there's one unique guy.
Wonder what he's like?"

18:11.970 --> 18:15.290
And after watching you yesterday
and today, I made up my mind.

18:19.730 --> 18:21.310
You're a good guy.

18:22.830 --> 18:25.390
And when a guy like you to comes to this town…

18:26.600 --> 18:28.190
Of course it makes me happy.

18:32.240 --> 18:34.880
Then we coulda just had a welcoming party.

18:35.540 --> 18:37.500
That's better than Conversation Day.

18:37.740 --> 18:39.620
Oh, hey, you're right!

18:41.810 --> 18:42.950
That makes sense!

18:43.890 --> 18:44.870
How.

18:45.260 --> 18:45.960
Oh?

18:46.580 --> 18:49.240
How do you accept people so easily?!

18:49.960 --> 18:51.160
Pull them in?!

18:52.180 --> 18:54.030
You got everyone in town,

18:54.740 --> 18:56.440
even the guys at Furin…

18:57.240 --> 19:02.380
I came to be top dog! To take you down!

19:06.180 --> 19:07.890
But I can't do that…

19:09.110 --> 19:13.370
I've never accepted anyone before…

19:14.740 --> 19:17.610
That's why I aimed to get strong all on my own.

19:19.280 --> 19:25.290
Hell, I came here so I could
become top dog and accept myself!

19:26.830 --> 19:31.440
But… it turns out you need
other people's help to become top dog…

19:32.720 --> 19:34.830
And since I can't accept people,

19:35.650 --> 19:38.420
I can't be top dog…

19:39.490 --> 19:41.860
W-Wait a sec, Sakura!

19:48.750 --> 19:53.810
S-Sakura, you told me yesterday
that I wasn't lame!

19:55.160 --> 19:56.310
But, well…

19:57.030 --> 19:58.550
You're not lame.

19:58.940 --> 20:01.990
You actually paid attention to me!

20:02.500 --> 20:04.880
That made me super happy!

20:06.230 --> 20:07.720
And that means you…!

20:09.180 --> 20:10.200
Um…

20:10.640 --> 20:13.310
Huh?! What was I trying to say, again?

20:14.020 --> 20:16.480
Don't worry. He got the message.

20:18.420 --> 20:19.440
So, Sakura,

20:19.810 --> 20:22.720
do you know what it takes
to converse with your fists?

20:23.140 --> 20:24.220
No, what?

20:24.880 --> 20:28.830
You need to face each other,
and want to know the other guy.

20:29.600 --> 20:31.360
And you did that.

20:33.010 --> 20:35.210
That's how you conversed with Togame.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.080
I wanna know.

20:37.380 --> 20:38.720
What's his deal?

20:39.750 --> 20:42.820
I'm not saying you gotta accept
everyone and everything,

20:43.340 --> 20:48.140
but, well, if you want to accept people,
you have to face them first.

20:49.470 --> 20:51.740
And you can do that.

20:52.020 --> 20:54.660
And far as I can see,
you want to accept people.

20:55.490 --> 20:57.820
You haven't given up on people.

20:58.450 --> 20:59.870
And you don't have to.

21:00.530 --> 21:01.970
Turn towards me.

21:02.670 --> 21:03.900
- Do that, and you can be whatever you want.

21:03.900 --> 21:07.080
- Do that, and you can be whatever you want.
- You'll be able to become what you wanted.

21:08.090 --> 21:10.540
You can even become top dog!

21:11.810 --> 21:12.640
'Kay?

21:25.960 --> 21:28.280
I-If I become top dog,

21:28.390 --> 21:30.570
that'd mean I beat you!

21:32.230 --> 21:35.200
There is that! But that's
for future me to deal with!

21:36.160 --> 21:36.950
Oh?

21:37.040 --> 21:39.190
What's up, Sugishita? Gotta take a leak?

21:40.820 --> 21:41.910
You're dead!

21:42.020 --> 21:44.920
What, you wanna go?! Then let's go!

21:45.690 --> 21:47.660
H-Hang on, Sugishita!

21:47.730 --> 21:49.990
He had murder in his eyes this whole time!

21:50.160 --> 21:53.070
What do you guys think you're doing?!

21:53.440 --> 21:56.300
If you're gonna fight, take it outside!

21:57.010 --> 21:59.990
[#10: Conversation]

23:30.530 --> 23:33.590
Umemiya's got a soft spot for Kotoha, right?

23:33.880 --> 23:35.170
He sure does.

23:35.480 --> 23:39.310
Then that means Bofurin's real top dog is…

23:42.620 --> 23:44.600
So you went and figured it out…
